      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why are you calling them \"shadow goblins\" and \"goblin guides\"? I was just asking about the historical groups like local guides or smugglers, I didn't expect you to talk about actual mythological creatures. Can you please just give me the historical details without the goblin stuff? I need to stay focused on the academic side for my slides.",
